  DisplayName: Warren
  Description: 'Meerkats only, in an empty cell. Everything you lay is yours - your trail, and the exit
    portal every soliton rings its way out with, bigger with Mass. Form a soliton beside a
    rival''s mass and it swallows it and fires it back into the rest of it, breaking both.
    When the clock runs out, the team with the most standing wins. Higher intensities thin
    the crystals, start everyone at Mass 5 (danger portals) and then Space 5 (a soliton
    steals what it swallows).'
